// The hero groom: Cem Yuksel's `wCurly.hair` — 50,000 strands and
// 3,441,580 points, per-strand segment counts (56 to 72 each), the file's
// default thickness throughout. Swept three-sided, that is 20.35 million
// triangles, and it is the asset B12's gates are set against.
//
// The groom itself stays untracked: the hair models are free for
// research with attribution, not to redistribute. Fetch them from
// http://www.cemyuksel.com/research/hairmodels/ into `scenes/hair/sources/`.
//
// Same units and orientation as `straight.ron` — Z-up, a head about 63
// across — so the same rotate-and-shrink lands it on a 15 cm skull, and
// the translation drops the tips onto y = 0. The camera frames the groom
// alone: no ground, no second object, so every millisecond of traversal
// this scene reports is hair.
(
    version: 2,
    ops: [
        Settings((name: "main", resolution: Some((2560, 1440)), spp: Some(64))),
        Camera((
            name: "main",
            position: Some((-0.037, 0.147, 0.50)),
            look_at: Some((-0.037, 0.147, 0.0)),
            vfov_degrees: Some(35.0),
        )),
        Environment((
            name: "sky",
            path: Some(Some("../../crates/cenote/assets/kloofendal_puresky.exr")),
        )),
        Curves((name: "hair", source: Some(Hair(path: "sources/wCurly.hair")))),
        Material((
            name: "fiber",
            base_color: Some(Constant((0.09, 0.045, 0.02))),
            specular_roughness: Some(Constant(0.2)),
        )),
        Instance((
            name: "hair",
            curves: Some("hair"),
            material: Some("fiber"),
            transforms: Some([Trs(
                translate: (0.024, 0.13, 0.0),
                rotate_degrees: (-90.0, 0.0, 0.0),
                scale: (0.0024, 0.0024, 0.0024),
            )]),
        )),
    ],
)
